"state-operator-typing", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT"}]}, "conclusion": {"expression_latex": "\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H}_d)=\\left\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)\\mid\\exists (p_i)_{i\\in I_d},\\ p_i\\geq0,\\ \\sum_{i\\in I_d}p_i=1,\\ \\sigma=\\sum_{i\\in I_d}p_iS_i\\right\\}", "relation": "definition"}, "conventions": ["A probability distribution has nonnegative real entries summing to one.", "The source uses the same symbol $S_i$ for a pure stabilizer state and its density-operator representative."], "local_binders": [{"binder": "exists", "domain_latex": "\\mathbb{R}^{I_d}", "scope": "set_membership_condition", "variable_latex": "(p_i)_{i\\in I_d}"}], "mathematical_mode": {"exactness": "exact", "finite_or_asymptotic": "finite"}, "quantifiers": [{"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\{p\\in\\mathbb{N}:p\\text{ is prime}\\}", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "variable_latex": "d"}], "typed_objects": [{"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "prime_natural_number", "symbol_latex": "d"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "finite_index_set", "symbol_latex": "I_d"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_d", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "pure_stabilizer_density_operator", "symbol_latex": "S_i"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "real_number", "symbol_latex": "p_i"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_d", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\sigma"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_d", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "set_of_density_operators", "symbol_latex": "\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H}_d)"}]}, "supersedes": null}
{"artifact": {"artifact_hash": "sha256:dab950dc06046c23417046d3d9180e872cf26ba158eb29ada0cd7f05cf9f2831", "schema_uri": "https://agtxiv.org/schema/math-claimir/1.0.0", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "serialization_profile": {"content_hash": "sha256:5d1274af89953b515bfc41caf2813dad2334b9de2176e942366aa650127a434c", "id": "agtxiv.canonical-json/1.0.0"}}, "claim": {"content_hash": "sha256:14ee4feed9d603964de9937c31b34dbd311ba748eb2a95d993534690d65bd266", "id": "claim:1307.7171v1:magic-membership", "record_revision": 1}, "id": "math-claim-ir:1307.7171v1:magic-membership", "normalization": {"preprocessing_record_ref": "source-preprocessing:1307.7171v1:resource-theory-of-stabilizer-computation", "profile": "agtxiv.expanded-standard-latex/1.0.0", "relation_to_source": "LOGICAL_FORM_EXPANDED", "unresolved_symbols": []}, "normalized_statement_expanded_latex": "For every finite-dimensional Hilbert space $\\mathcal{H}$ equipped with the source-defined stabilizer-state set $\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H})$, and every density operator $\\rho\\in\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H})$, $\\rho$ is magic if and only if $\\rho\\notin\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H})$.", "produced_at": "2026-08-22T00:00:00Z", "revision": 1, "schema": "agtxiv.math-claimir/1.0.0", "semantic_content_hash": "sha256:b3d4c67ae244ad80c264b6d088ed02e735f427de62b94d38dc2c5062babd5583", "source": {"occurrence_work": "arxiv:1307.7171v1", "proof_anchors": [], "source_statement_expanded_latex": "A state is magic if it is not a stabilizer state.", "statement_anchors": ["anchor:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol-and-monotone", "anchor:1307.7171v1:resource-split"]}, "statement_kind": "definition", "structured_statement": {"assumptions": {"explicit": [], "source_implicit": [{"expression_latex": "\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H})\\text{ is the source-defined set of stabilizer states on }\\mathcal{H}", "id": "stabilizer-set-available", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT"}]}, "conclusion": {"expression_latex": "\\rho\\text{ is magic}\\Longleftrightarrow\\rho\\notin\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H})", "relation": "if_and_only_if"}, "conventions": ["The introductory term ``state that cannot be prepared using the stabilizer formalism is normalized to the explicit later definition ``not a stabilizer state."], "local_binders": [], "mathematical_mode": {"exactness": "exact", "finite_or_asymptotic": "finite"}, "quantifiers": [{"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\{K:K\\text{ is a finite-dimensional complex Hilbert space}\\}", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT", "variable_latex": "\\mathcal{H}"}, {"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H})", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "variable_latex": "\\rho"}], "typed_objects": [{"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "finite_dimensional_complex_hilbert_space", "symbol_latex": "\\mathcal{H}"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\rho"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "set_of_stabilizer_density_operators", "symbol_latex": "\\operatorname{STAB}(\\mathcal{H})"}]}, "supersedes": null}
{"artifact": {"artifact_hash": "sha256:995488ce07d9c1b4e75a30120661271bf4d5bf9ec7b30f52ef4d012b34c9ff8d", "schema_uri": "https://agtxiv.org/schema/math-claimir/1.0.0", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "serialization_profile": {"content_hash": "sha256:5d1274af89953b515bfc41caf2813dad2334b9de2176e942366aa650127a434c", "id": "agtxiv.canonical-json/1.0.0"}}, "claim": {"content_hash": "sha256:6286ad18ffc3372fff85c46a2fcb0a24e57cd561fb26fa0798618175408136ed", "id": "claim:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol", "record_revision": 1}, "id": "math-claim-ir:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol", "normalization": {"preprocessing_record_ref": "source-preprocessing:1307.7171v1:resource-theory-of-stabilizer-computation", "profile": "agtxiv.expanded-standard-latex/1.0.0", "relation_to_source": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT_CONTEXT_EXPLICIT", "unresolved_symbols": []}, "normalized_statement_expanded_latex": "For every finite local dimension $d$ and nonnegative integers $n,m$, a stabilizer protocol $\\Lambda:\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_{d^n})\\to\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_{d^m})$ is any map composed from Clifford conjugations $\\rho\\mapsto U\\rho U^{\\dagger}$, adjoining a stabilizer state $\\rho\\mapsto\\rho\\otimes S$, computational-basis measurement of the final qudit with its normalized conditional outputs and Born probabilities, partial trace of the final qudit, and conditioning these operations on measurement outcomes or classical randomness.", "produced_at": "2026-08-22T00:00:00Z", "revision": 1, "schema": "agtxiv.math-claimir/1.0.0", "semantic_content_hash": "sha256:470b69e29af283a63ff788f2735da6f02ad6be24c4095e4a2abb9bc31c6798cf", "source": {"occurrence_work": "arxiv:1307.7171v1", "proof_anchors": [], "source_statement_expanded_latex": "A stabilizer protocol is any map from $\\rho\\in\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_{d^n})$ to $\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_{d^m})$ composed from: Clifford unitaries; composition with stabilizer states; computational-basis measurement on the final qudit; partial trace of the final qudit; and these operations conditioned on measurement outcomes or classical randomness.", "statement_anchors": ["anchor:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-operations", "anchor:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol-and-monotone"]}, "statement_kind": "definition", "structured_statement": {"assumptions": {"explicit": [], "source_implicit": [{"expression_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_{d^k}\\cong(\\mathbb{C}^{d})^{\\otimes k}", "id": "finite-dimensional-domain", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT"}]}, "conclusion": {"expression_latex": "\\Lambda\\in\\operatorname{Closure}\\!\\left(\\text{Clifford conjugation},\\text{ stabilizer-state adjoining},\\text{ final-qudit computational-basis measurement},\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathrm{final}},\\text{ classical or outcome conditioning}\\right)", "relation": "definition"}, "conventions": ["Computational-basis measurement includes the normalized conditional state and its Born probability.", "Composition and conditioning are finite protocol constructions."], "local_binders": [], "mathematical_mode": {"exactness": "exact", "finite_or_asymptotic": "finite"}, "quantifiers": [{"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\mathbb{N}_{\\geq2}", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT", "variable_latex": "d"}, {"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\mathbb{N}_0", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT", "variable_latex": "n"}, {"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\mathbb{N}_0", "origin": "SOURCE_IMPLICIT", "variable_latex": "m"}], "typed_objects": [{"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "finite_local_hilbert_space_dimension", "symbol_latex": "d"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "nonnegative_integer", "symbol_latex": "n"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "nonnegative_integer", "symbol_latex": "m"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_{d^n}", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\rho"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{H}_{d^m}", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\sigma"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "stabilizer_protocol", "symbol_latex": "\\Lambda"}]}, "supersedes": null}
{"artifact": {"artifact_hash": "sha256:73a41772cf0f85304bb850b260a7cd43af4bcf6b2be01c00cfc0ae367731d8ce", "schema_uri": "https://agtxiv.org/schema/math-claimir/1.0.0", "schema_version": "1.0.0", "serialization_profile": {"content_hash": "sha256:5d1274af89953b515bfc41caf2813dad2334b9de2176e942366aa650127a434c", "id": "agtxiv.canonical-json/1.0.0"}}, "claim": {"content_hash": "sha256:6998f906d7a5180e626c9f093d2b49230be518daafea40ae7b7b48a1babf19cf", "id": "claim:1307.7171v1:magic-monotone", "record_revision": 1}, "id": "math-claim-ir:1307.7171v1:magic-monotone", "normalization": {"preprocessing_record_ref": "source-preprocessing:1307.7171v1:resource-theory-of-stabilizer-computation", "profile": "agtxiv.expanded-standard-latex/1.0.0", "relation_to_source": "LOGICAL_FORM_EXPANDED", "unresolved_symbols": []}, "normalized_statement_expanded_latex": "A family $\\{\\mathcal{M}_d:\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)\\to\\mathbb{R}\\}_{d\\geq1}$ defines a magic monotone $\\mathcal{M}$ if, for every density operator $\\rho$ and every stabilizer protocol whose outcomes are $\\sigma_i$ with probabilities $p_i$, $\\sum_i p_i\\mathcal{M}(\\sigma_i)\\leq\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)$. This average condition does not require every postselected branch to satisfy $\\mathcal{M}(\\sigma_i)\\leq\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)$.", "produced_at": "2026-08-22T00:00:00Z", "revision": 1, "schema": "agtxiv.math-claimir/1.0.0", "semantic_content_hash": "sha256:42482ebfb1d883ec712168aff3feefef052ffedd2e554875ecd4839edcf65319", "source": {"occurrence_work": "arxiv:1307.7171v1", "proof_anchors": [], "source_statement_expanded_latex": "For each $d$, let $\\mathcal{M}_d:\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)\\to\\mathbb{R}$, and define $\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)=\\mathcal{M}_d(\\rho)$ for the appropriate $d$. If, on average, $\\mathcal{M}(\\Lambda(\\rho))\\leq\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)$ for every stabilizer protocol $\\Lambda$, then $\\mathcal{M}$ is a magic monotone; if $\\Lambda(\\rho)=\\sigma_i$ with probability $p_i$, the requirement is $\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)\\geq\\sum_i p_i\\mathcal{M}(\\sigma_i)$.", "statement_anchors": ["anchor:1307.7171v1:magic-monotone", "anchor:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol-and-monotone"]}, "statement_kind": "definition", "structured_statement": {"assumptions": {"explicit": [{"expression_latex": "\\Lambda(\\rho)=\\sigma_i\\text{ with probability }p_i", "id": "outcome-ensemble", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "source_anchor": "anchor:1307.7171v1:stabilizer-protocol-and-monotone"}], "source_implicit": []}, "conclusion": {"expression_latex": "\\sum_i p_i\\mathcal{M}(\\sigma_i)\\leq\\mathcal{M}(\\rho)", "relation": "less_than_or_equal"}, "conventions": ["The inequality is an average over protocol outcomes.", "An individual postselected branch is permitted to increase the monotone; this is a clarification of average monotonicity, not a second defining conclusion.", "Convexity is not part of the definition."], "local_binders": [{"binder": "family", "domain_latex": "\\prod_{d\\geq1}\\left(\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)\\to\\mathbb{R}\\right)", "scope": "definition", "variable_latex": "(\\mathcal{M}_d)_{d\\geq1}"}], "mathematical_mode": {"exactness": "exact", "finite_or_asymptotic": "finite"}, "quantifiers": [{"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\mathbb{N}_{\\geq1}", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "variable_latex": "d"}, {"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\bigcup_{d\\geq1}\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "variable_latex": "\\rho"}, {"binder": "forall", "domain_latex": "\\{\\text{stabilizer protocols applicable to }\\rho\\}", "origin": "SOURCE_EXPLICIT", "variable_latex": "\\Lambda"}], "typed_objects": [{"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "positive_integer", "symbol_latex": "d"}, {"carrier_latex": "\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{H}_d)", "scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "real_valued_function_on_density_operators", "symbol_latex": "\\mathcal{M}_d"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\rho"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "stabilizer_protocol", "symbol_latex": "\\Lambda"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "density_operator", "symbol_latex": "\\sigma_i"}, {"scope": "claim", "semantic_type": "probability", "symbol_latex": "p_i"}]}, "supersedes": null}
